<title>GERMANY: BW-Bank nine-mo operating profit up.</title>
<headline>BW-Bank nine-mo operating profit up.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months to end-September</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    85.6   vs 81.8</p>
<p>    Risk provisions			     40.4   vs 36.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Baden-Wuerttembergische Bank AG.  </p>
<p>    Interest income			     1,255  vs 1,110.7</p>
<p>    Interest costs				961.9  vs 832.6</p>
<p>    Commissions earned			  88.6   vs 75.0</p>
<p>    Commissions paid			    8.9    vs 6.9</p>
<p>    Gross proceeds				417.6  vs 383.0</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
